{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3327","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3327","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3327\",\"parent_revision\":\"51e0fc1393980a88a7ec5eeabc9bbcfe17150d2382e3f71eb5d54843c6eece44\",\"root_revision\":\"51e0fc1393980a88a7ec5eeabc9bbcfe17150d2382e3f71eb5d54843c6eece44\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P2\\ntype: Bug\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-08-29\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nDuring #3151's quality-gate multi-perspective-review swarm (ephemeral plan P38ce5ead, GitHub-backed), `sam_task(action='claim')` returned `claimed: false` with a self-contradictory status message (\\\"not-started, not not-started\\\") on the first two attempts for task T4. A third attempt succeeded.\\n\\nRoot cause identified by the T4 agent: a transient GitHub API `403 Forbidden` (rate-limit/backoff) on the underlying `GET /repos/...` call, not an actual task-state conflict \u2014 the agent re-read the task's status directly and confirmed it stayed `not-started` throughout both failed attempts. The claim path is swallowing or misinterpreting the 403 and surfacing it to the caller as a state-conflict message instead of the real transient-API-error condition.\\n\\nThe same agent reported this pattern affected tasks T2, T3, and T4 in the same swarm run (per a peer's report, not independently re-verified by this session beyond T4).\\n\\nImpact: an agent or orchestrator seeing \\\"claimed: false, not-started (not not-started)\\\" has no way to distinguish \\\"someone else has this task\\\" (a real conflict, should back off) from \\\"transient network/API failure, retry\\\" (should just retry) \u2014 the current error message actively points at the wrong cause.\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Agent task - auto-derived from input\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-08-29\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"5f0eeeecde30911067d6821b1e9eb3a82760abed8d77cccdad761aae0d4f26ff\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABRaDNPg\"}"}